{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1525226-the-magical-history-tour-a-changeling-mage-dark-era","id":1525226,"title":"The Magical History Tour: A Changeling/Mage Dark Era","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-11-08T16:45:41-08:00","id":1525226,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> The Magical History Tour: A Changeling/Mage Dark Era","content":"Since <a href=\"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-beatles-release-their-last-song-now-and-then-ai-john-lennon-180983188/\" target=\"_blank\">the Beatles are in the news again</a>, I thought now was an ideal time for me to post a Dark Era that's inspired by their work and their lives: I call it <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uFgCI8m4gJ5kg1DneG0Cgu18bmUpe4RxDNDfI824G6M/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Magical History Tour</a>, and it's for Mage and Changeling 2e. It's still a bit of a WIP, so anyone who feels like contributing a fully-statted character, a spell or Contract, or a new or updated Legacy or Entitlement, just shoot me a line and I'll drop it in the doc if I think it's appropriate and Beatles-y enough to go in. <b><a href=\"https://emojipedia.org/victory-hand\" target=\"_blank\">\u270c\ufe0f</a></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/856697-motor-city-breakdown-a-playable-changeling-setting-for-detroit-michigan\" target=\"_blank\">Motor City Breakdown</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19D2lK7otRprpHsJz0aZF0WucpMtoEgGQ2ExZJ-ud0a4/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">Devil's Night in the D</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uFgCI8m4gJ5kg1DneG0Cgu18bmUpe4RxDNDfI824G6M/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">The Magical History Tour</a><br /> Accuracy Consultant on <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/AshesOfTheMotorCity.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Ashes of the Motor City</a><br /> Editor, Compiler, and Senior Contributor to <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OxlnZCafIZtgPMCfikl0DJvWAwZKJDLk6lxh9hFPB1g/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Seas</a><br /> <b>Current Project(s)</b>: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15v9c9IWq_HOjZoYPWqceTxQ0-z1epdN4pt5F6nMUYpE/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">We Have Fought the Long Defeat</a>, a Late Antiquity/Early Medieval Dark Era for <i>Genius: The Transgression</i>; <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/12IQd13VQ0kHFY19yUBBkqVA-cKT0gZlByOkgYRkb-Ss/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Just Before the Dawn</i></a><i>,</i> a 1970s PtH Dark Era","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6327-super_dave","name":"Super_Dave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6327_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-09T06:42:10-08:00","id":1525248,"title":"","content":"Could you post exactly years you think of and general area of Dark Eras action? \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-09T10:37:51-08:00","id":1525261,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1525226-the-magical-history-tour-a-changeling-mage-dark-era?p=1525248#post1525248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could you post exactly years you think of and general area of Dark Eras action? \ud83e\udd14</div> </div> </div> </div>Short answer: &quot;The Sixties&quot;<br /> <br /> Long answer: John Lennon started The Quarrymen in 1956, then Paul and George joined and Stuart Sutcliffe and Pete Best were kicked to the curb, but not before Stuart suggested changing their name to &quot;The Beetles&quot; as a tribute to Buddy Holly and the Crickets. They had their big breakout on The Ed Sullivan Show in '64, spent the next several years touring the world and getting unimaginably famous, stopped touring in '66 because they couldn't hear themselves over the roar of the crowds, then broke up acrimoniously in 1970 when Paul left, but the group didn't legally dissolve until 29 December 1974.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/856697-motor-city-breakdown-a-playable-changeling-setting-for-detroit-michigan\" target=\"_blank\">Motor City Breakdown</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19D2lK7otRprpHsJz0aZF0WucpMtoEgGQ2ExZJ-ud0a4/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">Devil's Night in the D</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uFgCI8m4gJ5kg1DneG0Cgu18bmUpe4RxDNDfI824G6M/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">The Magical History Tour</a><br /> Accuracy Consultant on <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/AshesOfTheMotorCity.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Ashes of the Motor City</a><br /> Editor, Compiler, and Senior Contributor to <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OxlnZCafIZtgPMCfikl0DJvWAwZKJDLk6lxh9hFPB1g/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Seas</a><br /> <b>Current Project(s)</b>: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15v9c9IWq_HOjZoYPWqceTxQ0-z1epdN4pt5F6nMUYpE/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">We Have Fought the Long Defeat</a>, a Late Antiquity/Early Medieval Dark Era for <i>Genius: The Transgression</i>; <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/12IQd13VQ0kHFY19yUBBkqVA-cKT0gZlByOkgYRkb-Ss/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Just Before the Dawn</i></a><i>,</i> a 1970s PtH Dark Era","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6327-super_dave","name":"Super_Dave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6327_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-09T11:21:22-08:00","id":1525264,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Super_Dave</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1525226-the-magical-history-tour-a-changeling-mage-dark-era#post1525226\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since <a href=\"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-beatles-release-their-last-song-now-and-then-ai-john-lennon-180983188/\" target=\"_blank\">the Beatles are in the news again</a>, I thought now was an ideal time for me to post a Dark Era that's inspired by their work and their lives: I call it <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uFgCI8m4gJ5kg1DneG0Cgu18bmUpe4RxDNDfI824G6M/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Magical History Tour</a>, and it's for Mage and Changeling 2e. It's still a bit of a WIP, so anyone who feels like contributing a fully-statted character, a spell or Contract, or a new or updated Legacy or Entitlement, just shoot me a line and I'll drop it in the doc if I think it's appropriate and Beatles-y enough to go in. <b><a href=\"https://emojipedia.org/victory-hand\" target=\"_blank\">\u270c\ufe0f</a></b></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I have two Legacies that would be into the science fiction of the time (&quot;plausible&quot; psionics and such). It is a rough draft since I have not worked on them in a while:<br /> <br /> The Geniuses is inspired by Dune lots of Free Council vibes, but would be at home in the Mysterium (Savants would LOVE the power set):<br /> <br /> <br /> <u><i><b>Geniuses</b></i></u><br /> <b>Parentage:</b> Acanthus, Free Council or Mysterium<br /> <b>Ruling Arcanum:</b> Mind<br /> <b>Yantras:</b> Sources of knowledge (books, informants, etc.) as sacraments (Mage, p. 122); verbally explaining an occult or scientific phenomenon to an ignorant party (+1); planning out strategies and tactics to a goal (+1).<br /> <b>Oblations:</b> Engaging in unusual research; teaching or tutoring; pursuing an obsessive or antisocial habit.<br /> <br /> <b>Initiate </b>(<i>Savantism</i>)<br /> <u>Perfect Recall</u> - Instant Casting<br /> <u>Momentary Flux</u> - Instant Casting<br /> <br /> <b>Apprentice </b>(<i>Multitasker</i>)<br /> <u>One Mind, Two Thoughts</u> - Advanced Duration, &quot;Instant Tasks&quot;<br /> <u>Constant Presence</u> - Advanced Duration<br /> <br /> <b>Disciple </b>(<i>Extraordinary Defense</i>)<br /> <u>Mental Shield</u> - Advanced Duration, &quot;Goetia Attacks&quot;<br /> <u>Shield of Chronos</u> - Advanced Duration, &quot;Fabricate Timeline&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Adept </b>(<i>Inner Potential</i>)<br /> <u>Augment Mind</u> - Instant Casting, Advanced Duration<br /> <u>Shifting Sands</u> - Instant Casting, &quot;Scene Return&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Master </b>(<i>External Support</i>)<br /> <u>Social Networking</u> - Advanced Duration<br /> <u>Acceleration</u> - Advanced Duration, &quot;Dodge Actions&quot;, &quot;Extended Actions&quot;; Time in a Bottle\u200b\u200b<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Posthumans are more into some Asimov style psionics, but still grounded in natural science.<br /> <br /> <br /> <i><u><b>Posthumans</b></u></i><br /> <b>Parentage:</b> Mastigos, Free Council or Silver Ladder<br /> <b>Ruling Arcanum:</b> Life<br /> <b>Yantras:</b> Deliberately revealing extraordinary physical or mental capabilities (+1, +2 if superhuman abilities are shown); planning out strategies and tactics to a goal (+1).<br /> <b>Oblations:</b> Passionate sex, performing an exercise routine.\u200b<br /> <br /> <b>Initiate </b>(<i>Preparation</i>)<br /> <u>Analyze Life</u> - Instant Casting<br /> <u>Know Nature</u> - Instant Casting\u200b<br /> <br /> <b>Apprentice </b>(<i>Full Awareness</i>)<br /> <u>Heightened Senses</u> - Advanced Duration, &quot;Scent Tracking&quot;<br /> <u>One Mind, Two Thoughts</u> - Advanced Duration, &quot;Instant Tasks&quot;\u200b<br /> <br /> <b>Disciple </b>(<i>Healthy Body, Healthy Mind</i>)<br /> <u>Body Control</u> - Advanced Duration, &quot;1/0 Armor&quot;<br /> <u>Mental Shield</u> - Advanced Duration, &quot;Goetia Attacks&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Adept </b>(<i>Inner Potential</i>)<br /> <u>Honing the Form</u> - Instant Casting, Advanced Duration<br /> <u>Augment Mind</u> - Instant Casting, Advanced Duration<br /> <br /> <b>Master </b>(<i>New Allies</i>)<br /> <u>Create Life</u> - Advanced Duration\u200b\u200b<br /> <u>Social Networking</u> - Advanced Duration\u200b<br /> \u200b<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Feel free to use, expand and/or modify.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-09T12:16:27-08:00","id":1525265,"title":"","content":"I think the <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1449081-new-legacy-the-universal-harmony\">Universal Harmony</a> could be easily integrated into this setting, the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/889501-2e-legacy-mentats\">Mentats </a>as well. The <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1489398-homebrew-extraterrestrial-seekers-legacy\">Extraterrestrial Seekers</a> would also suit the era because the moon landing happened in 1969, which would make it be on top of mind. The <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e?p=1177786#post1177786\">People of the Hour</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded?p=1464237#post1464237\">Chronologues </a>make for a great contrasting pair. The <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e?p=1118770#post1118770\">Subtle Ones</a>, the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\">Szary Straznik</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e?p=1051832#post1051832\">Blank Badges</a> can be used to represent different responses to the New World Order conspiracy (unfortunately the Architects of the Future have not received a 2ed conversion yet). Those are the ones that come to mind, hope they synergize with your vision.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-09T20:49:01-08:00","id":1525286,"title":"","content":"In more broader strokes - 60s are start of counter culture, New Age and REAL start of Ancient Aliens Theory. ( There were voices for it in 50s but it's 60s where they become 'mainstream' in UFO) It's all the 'aliens build the piramids' that started there. <b>I would probably put much more emphazies that <i>Free Council is taking more and more members</i>, melting everything in New Age sauce</b>. Dimond and Seers are demoted by Operation Paper Clip shaky results. Race to Moon is also capturing Sleepers imagination with S-F myths of exploring cosmos and alien planets each year more and more. \ud83d\ude0e ( See <b>For All Mankind</b> TV series for this all. \ud83d\ude09) See <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Invisibles?wprov=sfla1\" target=\"_blank\"><b>The Invisibles</b></a> comic series for magically inspired 60s <br /> <br /> If you want to come all hardcore - you can make MK-Ultra project be finances by Gaurdians and Seers, laying foundations for New World Order of them - and literal magical 'Man in Black'. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-09-2023, 11:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-11T09:55:00-08:00","id":1525346,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>: The Universal Harmony is <i>definitely</i> going to in the Dark Era, I think they're awesome and extremely appropriate for the setting. I fear that Mentats would be a little under-utilized, since electronic computation was really in its infancy at the time (and it's established in your lore that they weren't founded until the '80s). People of the Hour and the Chronologues represent opposite reactions to the emergence of the counter-culture, so they might fit as well (Chronologues kind of remind me of the Clock King from <i>Batman: The Animated Series</i>). Not sure if the Subtle Ones, the Szary Straznik, and the Blank Badges really fit with a Beatles-centric Dark Era which is mostly a joke anyway, but they could all make fine additions to a more serious and general-scope CofD interpretation of the Sixties.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a>: that's a good point about the Free Council taking in more and more members, I might have to mention that in the lore somewhere. Do you know if anyone has made a Men In Black Legacy, or would they just be flunkies of the Seers?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/856697-motor-city-breakdown-a-playable-changeling-setting-for-detroit-michigan\" target=\"_blank\">Motor City Breakdown</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19D2lK7otRprpHsJz0aZF0WucpMtoEgGQ2ExZJ-ud0a4/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">Devil's Night in the D</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uFgCI8m4gJ5kg1DneG0Cgu18bmUpe4RxDNDfI824G6M/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">The Magical History Tour</a><br /> Accuracy Consultant on <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/AshesOfTheMotorCity.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Ashes of the Motor City</a><br /> Editor, Compiler, and Senior Contributor to <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OxlnZCafIZtgPMCfikl0DJvWAwZKJDLk6lxh9hFPB1g/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Seas</a><br /> <b>Current Project(s)</b>: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15v9c9IWq_HOjZoYPWqceTxQ0-z1epdN4pt5F6nMUYpE/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">We Have Fought the Long Defeat</a>, a Late Antiquity/Early Medieval Dark Era for <i>Genius: The Transgression</i>; <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/12IQd13VQ0kHFY19yUBBkqVA-cKT0gZlByOkgYRkb-Ss/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Just Before the Dawn</i></a><i>,</i> a 1970s PtH Dark Era","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6327-super_dave","name":"Super_Dave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6327_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-11T10:49:51-08:00","id":1525352,"title":"","content":"What would you be looking for in an MIB Legacy ? Would it be the ability to make sure the public doesn't know about what mages are doing in the background ? The <i>Bearers of the Eternal Voice</i> did that in 1ed, but I think their Neuralizer style Attainment didn't make it to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e?p=1058850#post1058850\">the version in the 2ed Legacy conversion thread</a>.<br /> <br /> If you are looking for a spook that is nearly impossible to trace, Cauthon is currently working on an idea in <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub\">his homebrew hub</a> that should be easily integrated into the Guardian's Project Nightfall (<i>Guardians of the Veil </i>Order book, page 57).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 11-11-2023, 01:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-11T11:08:41-08:00","id":1525353,"title":"","content":"DaveB also had some kind of G-Man Legacy for his version of Project Nightfall in Broken Diamond. I think it was a Subtle One variant? Even if I'm wrong about that, Subtle Ones are a good candidate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-11T14:28:00-08:00","id":1525361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1525226-the-magical-history-tour-a-changeling-mage-dark-era?p=1525353#post1525353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Subtle Ones are a good candidate.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm, that's actually a good point. With a bit of a twist to their lore, the Subtle Ones <i>would</i> make excellent stand-ins for G-men, MiBs, and the various flavors of government spooks. \ud83e\udd14<br /> <br /> Maybe I should expand the focused of this Dark Era a bit. Originally it was just a way to satisfy my own creative itch to design a Court system based around the Beatles' personalities, but then I added that epigram from The Sandman and it really began to expand. Perhaos I should revisit and expand this Dark Era when I'm not feeling quite so wretchedly sick. \ud83e\udd27","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/856697-motor-city-breakdown-a-playable-changeling-setting-for-detroit-michigan\" target=\"_blank\">Motor City Breakdown</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19D2lK7otRprpHsJz0aZF0WucpMtoEgGQ2ExZJ-ud0a4/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">Devil's Night in the D</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uFgCI8m4gJ5kg1DneG0Cgu18bmUpe4RxDNDfI824G6M/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">The Magical History Tour</a><br /> Accuracy Consultant on <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/AshesOfTheMotorCity.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Ashes of the Motor City</a><br /> Editor, Compiler, and Senior Contributor to <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OxlnZCafIZtgPMCfikl0DJvWAwZKJDLk6lxh9hFPB1g/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Seas</a><br /> <b>Current Project(s)</b>: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15v9c9IWq_HOjZoYPWqceTxQ0-z1epdN4pt5F6nMUYpE/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">We Have Fought the Long Defeat</a>, a Late Antiquity/Early Medieval Dark Era for <i>Genius: The Transgression</i>; <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/12IQd13VQ0kHFY19yUBBkqVA-cKT0gZlByOkgYRkb-Ss/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Just Before the Dawn</i></a><i>,</i> a 1970s PtH Dark Era","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6327-super_dave","name":"Super_Dave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6327_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-11T22:35:02-08:00","id":1525366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1525226-the-magical-history-tour-a-changeling-mage-dark-era?p=1525352#post1525352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you are looking for a spook that is nearly impossible to trace, Cauthon is currently working on an idea in <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub\">his homebrew hub</a> that should be easily integrated into the Guardian's Project Nightfall (<i>Guardians of the Veil </i>Order book, page 57).</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Project Nightfall</b> is also working with timeline of this era, if I remember correctly. ( Checking <b>GotV</b> book... )<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Guradians of the Veil, p.57</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">'<b>Project Nightfall</b><br /> <i>Mages move through the Fallen World with delicate steps. Most mages take pains to hide their Awakened natures from Sleepers. Guardians of the Veil are some of the greatest exponents and enforcers of this policy. The Labyrinth exists to distract the unworthy, so that Awakened truth doesn\u2019t fall right into their laps. This keeps the Diamond Wheel pure so that the wisest souls can direct its turn toward the world\u2019s liberation. Sometime in the late 1960s, an all-Guardian cabal in Washington, DC, decided it had learned the arts of misdirection all too well, but were tired of waiting for the Hieromagus, Atlantis\u2019 return and all of the other idealistic, distant goals of the order. They were in the right time and place to have a much more immediate effect on the world. They had occult power and a finger on the pulses of American and Soviet espionage. In short, they wanted a piece of the action for themselves.(...)<br /> By late 1972, Project Nightfall enjoyed a salary pilfered from various \u201cblack book\u201d discretionary funds and was thought to be one of several informal groups US intelligence turned to when the intelligence community needed to learn more about strange phenomena. At the same time, the cabal used its Arts and cunning to direct the members\u2019 own operations. Project Nightfall became a name to mention in select Washington offi ces; cabal members spread half-truths about UFOs and remote viewing while they meddled in affairs from Southeast Asia to Moscow. Sleeper agents stole magical artifacts and harassed cabal enemies while thinking they were fighting communism or repatriating stolen property.'</i></div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}